Third-party data

src/sources/cityServicesData.ts holds content of the Prefeitura Municipal de Curitiba — Carta de Serviços
(https://www.curitiba.pr.gov.br/servicos/): service titles, categories, the listing's short descriptions and links,
captured 2026-11-19/20 from the listing pages. It is not covered by this repository's Apache-2.0 licence. No terms of
use or licence for that content was found; it is reproduced unchanged (apart from the masking described in
docs/sources.md), attributed to the Prefeitura and linked to the source. It will be removed on request of the
Prefeitura Municipal de Curitiba.
